    "description": {
      "en": "Zero-shot TTS system with voice cloning, emotion-speaker decoupling, text or audio emotion control, and explicit duration control. Variant v2 covers Chinese and English; variant v2.5 (config version 2.5) adds multilingual tiktoken tokenization with Japanese, Spanish and Arabic support.",
      "zh": "零样本 TTS 系统，支持音色克隆、情绪与说话人解耦、文本或音频情绪控制，以及显式时长控制。v2 变体覆盖中文和英文；v2.5 变体（配置版本 2.5）增加基于 tiktoken 的多语言分词，支持日语、西班牙语和阿拉伯语。"
    },
